  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">允许通过数据包将战利品表整合到其他战利品表中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该数据包还允许你控制生成的战利品表产出的物品数量，例如将战利品箱的物品总数限制为12个。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/871d58d3350296151c3b17395d002dbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">点击此处查看使用指南</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">仅需在服务器端安装</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">新版本需要安装 <strong>Cupboard</strong> 依赖项 </a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>首次打开容器时，在聊天栏显示其战利品表</li>\n<li>添加战利品时，增加模组物品的掉落几率</li>\n<li>跳过已存在于战利品中的物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">用于结构类模组的附属模组，可提供更优质的战利品并增强模组兼容性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-loot-addon-for-loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版随机战利品兼容</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-adventure-dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冒险与地牢</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-awesome-dungeon\" rel=\"nofollow\">精彩地牢</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-better-archeology\" rel=\"nofollow\">更佳考古</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-bygone-nether-it-takes-a-pillage\" rel=\"nofollow\">逝去的下界 &amp; 强盗时代</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-choicetheorems-overhauled\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChoiceTheorem的重构村庄 &amp; 沉浸式建筑</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeon-crawl\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢探索</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-enhanced-lootintegration-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">增强型地牢</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeons-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多地牢</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeons-and-taverns\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢与酒馆</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeonz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢Z</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-formations-overworld-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\">地表与下界建筑群</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-hopo-better-mineshaft-ruins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hopo的更佳矿洞、遗迹与传送门</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰与火之歌</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-integrated-dungeons-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合地牢、村庄与要塞</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender的灾变</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-medieval-buildings-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">中世纪建筑 &amp; 末地</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-mo-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多建筑</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-moogs-voyager-soaring-end-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog的旅行者、翱翔、末地与下界建筑</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-philips-ruins\" rel=\"nofollow\">菲利普遗迹</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-piglet-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">小猪仔建筑</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-stellarity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">星穹序曲</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-structory-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">建筑与塔楼</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-the-graveyard\" rel=\"nofollow\">墓地</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-the-lost-castle\" rel=\"nofollow\">失落城堡</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">城镇与塔楼</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-valhelsia-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">瓦尔赫利亚建筑</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢崛起之时</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-yggdrasils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">世界树</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yung-structures-addon-for-loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yung的建筑</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p>如果你喜欢本模组，请考虑支持开发工作，任何支持都将不胜感激。</p>\n<p>模组开发属于业余时间活动，因此任何支持都能帮助我投入更多时间进行开发。<br>你可以在Patreon上支持我：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p>",
